A vocative particle used in addressing persons, and
 translatable by ‘o’, ‘sir’, ‘oh’, ‘halloo’, {sic} ‘ah’; (it drops its
 final {%visarga%} before vowels and soft consonants); {#kaH ko'tra#}
 {#BoH#} <ls>Ś. 2</ls>; {#ayi Bo maharziputra#} <ls>Ś. 7</ls>; it is sometimes repeated; {#Bo#}
 {#BoH SaMkaragfhADivAsino jAnapadAH#} <ls>Māl. 3</ls>; {#Bo BoH paRqitAH SrUyatAm#}
 <ls>H.</ls> {#Bos#} is said to have, in addition, the senses of ‘sorrow’ and ‘interrogation’.
